To compute \( \lim_{n \to \infty} \int_{0}^{\pi/3} \frac{1}{1+\tan^n(x)}\,dx \), we analyze the behavior of the integrand \( \frac{1}{1+\tan^n(x)} \) as \( n \to \infty \).

