\]

Substitute \( g(y) = a_1 y + a_2 y^2 + a_3 y^3 \):

\[
(a_1 y + a_2 y^2 + a_3 y^3) + \frac{(a_1 y + a_2 y^2 + a_3 y^3)^2}{2} + \frac{(a_1 y + a_2 y^2 + a_3 y^3)^3}{3} \approx y
\]

Equating coefficients:

